WEBVTT

00:08:29.196 --> 00:08:31.716
This is important for contractors

00:08:31.716 --> 00:08:35.156
because it creates a predictable demand

00:08:35.196 --> 00:08:37.436
for zero-emission solutions.

00:08:38.796 --> 00:08:42.436
Other cities in Norway have started
using the same kind of criteria.

00:08:42.996 --> 00:08:48.676
And the result is that the availability
of zero-emission machines

00:08:48.676 --> 00:08:51.556
is increasing every year in Norway.

00:08:52.236 --> 00:08:54.716
So fourth lesson,

00:08:54.756 --> 00:08:58.556
never, ever underestimate
how much you can change

00:08:58.596 --> 00:09:01.076
by being a demanding customer.